          "text": "Description: On August 21, 2010, at 11:30 PM, three witnesses observed from their apartment terrace three balls of light moving rapidly in the cloudy sky. The phenomenon abruptly disappeared. Of low strangeness and insufficient consistency due to the absence of any directional or elevation indicators, we cannot definitively identify the origin of what was very likely a multiple-beam nightclub lighting.",
